REQUIREMENT ANALYSIS

Project Title:
Student Hub Portal

Project Description:
Student Hub Portal is a simple web-based application developed using HTML. It provides students with easy access to different academic pages such as Login, Dashboard, Courses, Attendance, Assignments, Results, Notices, Profile, and Contact.

Functional Requirements:
• Home Page
• Login Page
• Dashboard Page
• Courses Page
• Attendance Page
• Assignments Page
• Results Page
• Notice Page
• Profile Page
• Contact Page
• Navigation Links
• Student Hub Image

Non-Functional Requirements:
• User-friendly interface
• Simple and clean design
• Easy navigation
• Fast loading pages
• Compatible with modern web browsers

Software Requirements:
• HTML5
• Visual Studio Code
• Google Chrome / Microsoft Edge

Hardware Requirements:
• Computer or Laptop
• Keyboard and Mouse
• Minimum 4 GB RAM

Input:
• User clicks on navigation links to access different pages.

Output:
• Displays the selected page based on the user's choice.

Modules:
• Home
• Login
• Dashboard
• Courses
• Attendance
• Assignments
• Results
• Notice
• Profile
• Contact